        {
            "id": "http://yoursite.com/note/DataStructure/%E5%93%88%E5%B8%8C%E8%A1%A8%20(%20Hash%20Table%20)%20/",
            "url": "http://yoursite.com/note/DataStructure/%E5%93%88%E5%B8%8C%E8%A1%A8%20(%20Hash%20Table%20)%20/",
            "title": "哈希表（Hash Table）",
            "date_published": "2025-08-30T18:30:00.000Z",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"note info\">\n<p>以下為個人筆記</p>\n</div>\n<h1 id=\"hash-table\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#hash-table\">#</a> Hash Table</h1>\n<h2 id=\"定義\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#定義\">#</a> 定義</h2>\n<p>哈希表（Hash Table）是一種透過 <strong>哈希函數（Hash Function）</strong> 將 <strong>Key</strong> 映射到 <strong>陣列位置（Index）</strong> 的資料結構。<br />\n哈希表主要用來快速查找、插入與刪除資料，平均時間複雜度可達 O (1)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"特性\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#特性\">#</a> 特性</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Key → Index：利用哈希函數把 key 轉換成陣列索引。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>快速存取：理想狀況下，插入、搜尋、刪除的平均時間複雜度為 O (1)。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>需處理衝突（Collision）：不同的 key 可能被映射到同一個 index。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>空間換取時間：通常需要額外空間來減少衝突。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"結構\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#結構\">#</a> 結構</h2>\n<p>一個 Hash Table 主要包含：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>陣列（Buckets/Slots）：存放資料的容器。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>哈希函數（Hash Function）：將 key 映射成 index 的演算法。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>衝突處理策略（Collision Resolution）。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"衝突處理方式\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#衝突處理方式\">#</a> 衝突處理方式</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>鏈結法（Chaining）<br />\n每個 bucket 對應一個 鏈結串列（Linked List） 或其他結構（如 BST）。<br />\n若多個 key 映射到相同 index，就放進同一個 bucket 的串列中。</li>\n<li>開放定址法（Open Addressing）<br />\n發生衝突時，嘗試在表中尋找下一個可用位置。常見方式有：</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>線性探測（Linear Probing）：依序往後找空位。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>平方探測（Quadratic Probing）：依照平方距離往後找。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>雙重哈希（Double Hashing）：使用另一個 hash function 來計算偏移量。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
            "tags": [
                "程式語言筆記",
                "資料結構",
                "筆記",
                "資料結構",
                "Hash Table"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "http://yoursite.com/record/1.%20Two%20Sum/",
            "url": "http://yoursite.com/record/1.%20Two%20Sum/",
            "title": "1. Two Sum",
            "date_published": "2025-08-30T17:10:14.000Z",
            "content_html": "<h1 id=\"題目連結\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#題目連結\">#</a> 題目連結</h1>\n<p><span class=\"exturl\" data-url=\"aHR0cHM6Ly9sZWV0Y29kZS5jb20vcHJvYmxlbXMvdHdvLXN1bS8=\">https://leetcode.com/problems/two-sum/</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"解題思路\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#解題思路\">#</a> 解題思路</h1>\n<p>看到這題，我第一個想法是用雙層 for 迴圈去解，但時間複雜度 O (n²)，於是我改用 Hash Table 將時間複雜度降至 O (n)</p>\n<h1 id=\"程式碼\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#程式碼\">#</a> 程式碼</h1>\n<h2 id=\"暴力解\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#暴力解\">#</a> 暴力解</h2>\n<p>C++ :</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight c++\"><figcaption><span>C++</span></figcaption><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"title class_\">Solution</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">public</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"function\">vector&lt;<span class=\"type\">int</span>&gt; <span class=\"title\">twoSum</span><span class=\"params\">(vector&lt;<span class=\"type\">int</span>&gt;&amp; nums, <span class=\"type\">int</span> target)</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span>(<span class=\"type\">int</span> i = <span class=\"number\">0</span>; i &lt; nums.<span class=\"built_in\">size</span>(); i++) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">          <span class=\"keyword\">for</span>(<span class=\"type\">int</span> j = i + <span class=\"number\">1</span>; j &lt; nums.<span class=\"built_in\">size</span>(); j++) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span>(nums[i] + nums[j] == target) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">              <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> &#123;i, j&#125;;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">          &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> &#123;&#125;;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>TypeScript :</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight typescript\"><figcaption><span>TypeScript</span></figcaption><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"title function_\">twoSum</span>(<span class=\"params\"><span class=\"attr\">nums</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">number</span>[], <span class=\"attr\">target</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">number</span></span>): <span class=\"built_in\">number</span>[] &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"keyword\">let</span> i = <span class=\"number\">0</span>; i &lt; nums.<span class=\"property\">length</span>; i++) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"keyword\">let</span> j = i + <span class=\"number\">1</span>; j &lt; nums.<span class=\"property\">length</span>; j++) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> (nums[i] + nums[j] === target) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> [i, j];</span><br><span class=\"line\">      &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> [-<span class=\"number\">1</span>, -<span class=\"number\">1</span>];</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"哈希表\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#哈希表\">#</a> 哈希表</h2>\n<p>C++ :</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight c++\"><figcaption><span>C++</span></figcaption><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"title class_\">Solution</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">public</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"function\">vector&lt;<span class=\"type\">int</span>&gt; <span class=\"title\">twoSum</span><span class=\"params\">(vector&lt;<span class=\"type\">int</span>&gt;&amp; nums, <span class=\"type\">int</span> target)</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      unordered_map&lt;<span class=\"type\">int</span>, <span class=\"type\">int</span>&gt; hash;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">for</span>(<span class=\"type\">int</span> i = <span class=\"number\">0</span>; i &lt; nums.<span class=\"built_in\">size</span>(); i++) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"type\">int</span> value = nums[i];</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span>(hash.<span class=\"built_in\">count</span>(target - value)) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">          <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> &#123;i, hash[target - value]&#125;;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        hash[value] = i;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> &#123;&#125;;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>TypeScript :</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight typescript\"><figcaption><span>TypeScript</span></figcaption><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"title function_\">twoSum</span>(<span class=\"params\"><span class=\"attr\">nums</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">number</span>[], <span class=\"attr\">target</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">number</span></span>): <span class=\"built_in\">number</span>[] &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">const</span> seen = <span class=\"keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"title class_\">Map</span>&lt;<span class=\"built_in\">number</span>, <span class=\"built_in\">number</span>&gt;();</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"keyword\">let</span> i = <span class=\"number\">0</span>; i &lt; nums.<span class=\"property\">length</span>; i++) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">const</span> complement = target - nums[i];</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">const</span> j = seen.<span class=\"title function_\">get</span>(complement);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> (j !== <span class=\"literal\">undefined</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> [j, i];</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> (!seen.<span class=\"title function_\">has</span>(nums[i])) seen.<span class=\"title function_\">set</span>(nums[i], i);</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"literal\">null</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h1 id=\"延伸閱讀\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#延伸閱讀\">#</a> 延伸閱讀</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span class=\"exturl\" data-url=\"aHR0cHM6Ly93YW5nLXlpbi5naXRodWIuaW8vbm90ZS9EYXRhU3RydWN0dXJlLyVFNSU5MyU4OCVFNSVCOCU4QyVFOCVBMSVBOCUyMCglMjBIYXNoJTIwVGFibGUlMjApJTIwLw==\">哈希表 (Hash Table)</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n",
            "tags": [
                "LeetCode 解題紀錄",
                "TypeScript",
                "LeetCode",
                "C++",
                "Hash Table"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "http://yoursite.com/note/DataStructure/%E9%8F%88%E7%B5%90%E4%B8%B2%E5%88%97%EF%BC%88Linked%20List%EF%BC%89/",
            "url": "http://yoursite.com/note/DataStructure/%E9%8F%88%E7%B5%90%E4%B8%B2%E5%88%97%EF%BC%88Linked%20List%EF%BC%89/",
            "title": "鏈結串列（Linked List）",
            "date_published": "2025-08-21T16:30:00.000Z",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"note info\">\n<p>以下為個人筆記</p>\n</div>\n<h1 id=\"linked-list\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#linked-list\">#</a> Linked List</h1>\n<h2 id=\"定義\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#定義\">#</a> 定義</h2>\n<p>由一組 <strong>節點 (Node)</strong> 所組成的 <strong>有序串列</strong> ，各 Node 除了 <strong>Data 欄</strong> 之外，另外有 <strong>&gt;= 1 個 Link 欄</strong> (或稱 Pointer)，用以指向其他 Node 之位址。</p>\n<h2 id=\"特性\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#特性\">#</a> 特性</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>各 Node 不一定要占用連續的記憶體空間。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>各 Node 之型態 (Data Type) 不一定要相同。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>僅支援循序存取。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>新增 / 刪除 Node 容易。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"種類\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#種類\">#</a> 種類</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>單向鏈結串列（Single Linked List）—— 1 個 Link 欄</li>\n<li>環狀鏈結串列（Circular Linked List）—— 1 個 Link 欄</li>\n<li>雙向鏈結串列（Double Linked List）—— 2 個 Link 欄</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"單向鏈結串列single-linked-list\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#單向鏈結串列single-linked-list\">#</a> 單向鏈結串列（Single Linked List）</h1>\n<h2 id=\"定義-2\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#定義-2\">#</a> 定義</h2>\n<p>由一組 <strong>節點 (Node)</strong> 所組成的 <strong>有序串列</strong> ，各 Node 除了 <strong>Data 欄</strong> 之外，另外有 <strong>1 個 Link 欄</strong> (或稱 Pointer)，用以指向其他 Node 之位址。</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Y96XZP96/Single.png\" alt=\"Single\" /></p>\n<h2 id=\"基本操作\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#基本操作\">#</a> 基本操作</h2>\n<h3 id=\"插入節點\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#插入節點\">#</a> 插入節點</h3>\n<p>插入節點可分三種情況，分別是在 List 的最前面、中間、最後面三種情況。</p>\n<h4 id=\"前面\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#前面\">#</a> 前面</h4>\n<p>建立一個新的 Node，之後將此 Node 的 Link 指向原本的 Head，更新 Head 為新 Node，使它成為新的起點。<br />\n<img data-src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/mZvr4Tw4/Insert-at-head.png\" alt=\"Insert-at-head\" /></p>\n<h4 id=\"中間\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#中間\">#</a> 中間</h4>\n<p>假設要將新的 Node 插在第 i 個位置，先將新節點的 next 指向原本第 (i+1) 個節點，再把第 i 個節點的 next 改成指向新節點。<br />\n<img data-src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/2jvdqsrS/Insert-at-middle.png\" alt=\"Insert-at-middle\" /></p>\n<h4 id=\"後面\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#後面\">#</a> 後面</h4>\n<p>建立一個新的 Node，將最後一個節點指向新節點即可。<br />\n<img data-src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Zn3X2VGx/Insert-at-tail.png\" alt=\"Insert-at-tail\" /></p>\n<h3 id=\"刪除節點\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#刪除節點\">#</a> 刪除節點</h3>\n<p>刪除節點跟插入節點一樣，分成前、中、後三種情況。</p>\n<h4 id=\"前面-2\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#前面-2\">#</a> 前面</h4>\n<p>直接把 head 移到 head.next ， 原本的第一個節點會被「丟掉」（若語言有垃圾回收就會自動釋放記憶體，否則需要手動釋放）。<br />\n<img data-src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/HW7LQdfM/Delete-head-node.png\" alt=\"Delete-head-node\" /></p>\n<h4 id=\"中間-2\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#中間-2\">#</a> 中間</h4>\n<p>找到<strong>欲刪除節點的前一個節點</strong>，讓它的 next 指向欲刪除節點的下一個節點，欲刪除節點就被「跳過」了。<br />\n<img data-src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/jd0kj4Hf/Delete-middle-node.png\" alt=\"Delete-middle-node\" /></p>\n<h4 id=\"後面-2\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#後面-2\">#</a> 後面</h4>\n<p>找到<strong>倒數第二個節點</strong>把它的 next 設為 null 即可。</p>\n",
            "tags": [
                "程式語言筆記",
                "資料結構",
                "筆記",
                "資料結構",
                "Linked List"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "http://yoursite.com/note/TypeScript/TypeScript02/",
            "url": "http://yoursite.com/note/TypeScript/TypeScript02/",
            "title": "第02章 TypeScript型別三劍客 —— 型別註釋、型別推論、型別斷言",
            "date_published": "2025-07-07T07:00:14.000Z",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"note info\">\n<p>以下為個人筆記</p>\n</div>\n<p>在 TypeScript 中，為值指定型別有三種方式。Type Annotation (型別註釋)、Type Inference (型別推論)、Type Assertions (型別斷言)。</p>\n<h1 id=\"type-annotation型別註釋\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#type-annotation型別註釋\">#</a> Type Annotation (型別註釋)</h1>\n<p>開發者可以主動明確宣告型別，讓 TypeScript 在編譯階段進行更嚴格的型別檢查，避免因錯誤型別導致的 bug。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基本語法\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#基本語法\">#</a> 基本語法:</h2>\n<figure class=\"highlight typescript\"><figcaption><span>typescript</span></figcaption><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> <span class=\"attr\">variableName</span>: <span class=\"keyword\">type</span> = value;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"常見型別註釋範例\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#常見型別註釋範例\">#</a> 常見型別註釋範例：</h2>\n<figure class=\"highlight typescript\"><figcaption><span>typescript</span></figcaption><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">// 基本型別</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> <span class=\"attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">string</span> = <span class=\"string\">&quot;Alice&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> <span class=\"attr\">age</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">number</span> = <span class=\"number\">30</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> <span class=\"attr\">isActive</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">boolean</span> = <span class=\"literal\">true</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">// 陣列</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> <span class=\"attr\">numbers</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">number</span>[] = [<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">2</span>, <span class=\"number\">3</span>];</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> <span class=\"attr\">names</span>: <span class=\"title class_\">Array</span>&lt;<span class=\"built_in\">string</span>&gt; = [<span class=\"string\">&quot;Alice&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;Bob&quot;</span>]; <span class=\"comment\">// 泛型語法</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">// 物件</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> <span class=\"attr\">person</span>: &#123; <span class=\"attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">string</span>; <span class=\"attr\">age</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">number</span> &#125; = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;Alice&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"attr\">age</span>: <span class=\"number\">30</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">// 函式參數與回傳值</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"title function_\">greet</span>(<span class=\"params\"><span class=\"attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">string</span></span>): <span class=\"built_in\">string</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"string\">`Hello, <span class=\"subst\">$&#123;name&#125;</span>`</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">// 可選參數</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"title function_\">printInfo</span>(<span class=\"params\"><span class=\"attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">string</span>, <span class=\"attr\">age</span>?: <span class=\"built_in\">number</span></span>): <span class=\"built_in\">void</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"string\">`Name: <span class=\"subst\">$&#123;name&#125;</span>, Age: <span class=\"subst\">$&#123;age || <span class=\"string\">&quot;unknown&quot;</span>&#125;</span>`</span>);</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h1 id=\"type-inference型別推論\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#type-inference型別推論\">#</a> Type Inference (型別推論)</h1>\n<p>在沒有明確指定型別時，TypeScript 會根據變數的初始值或表達式的結構自動推斷型別。</p>\n<h2 id=\"使用方式與範例\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#使用方式與範例\">#</a> 使用方式與範例</h2>\n<figure class=\"highlight typescript\"><figcaption><span>typescript</span></figcaption><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">// 基本型別推論</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> name = <span class=\"string\">&quot;Alice&quot;</span>; <span class=\"comment\">// 自動推論為 string 型別</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> age = <span class=\"number\">30</span>; <span class=\"comment\">// 自動推論為 number 型別</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> isActive = <span class=\"literal\">true</span>; <span class=\"comment\">// 自動推論為 boolean 型別</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">// 陣列推論</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> numbers = [<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">2</span>, <span class=\"number\">3</span>]; <span class=\"comment\">// 推論為 number[]</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> mixed = [<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;text&quot;</span>]; <span class=\"comment\">// 推論為 (number | string)[]</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">// 物件推論</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">let</span> person = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;Alice&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"attr\">age</span>: <span class=\"number\">30</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;; <span class=\"comment\">// 推論為 &#123; name: string; age: number &#125;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">// 函式回傳值推論</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"title function_\">add</span>(<span class=\"params\"><span class=\"attr\">a</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">number</span>, <span class=\"attr\">b</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">number</span></span>) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> a + b; <span class=\"comment\">// 回傳值自動推論為 number</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">// 上下文推論 (Contextual Typing)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">const</span> names = [<span class=\"string\">&quot;Alice&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;Bob&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;Charlie&quot;</span>];</span><br><span class=\"line\">names.<span class=\"title function_\">forEach</span>(<span class=\"function\">(<span class=\"params\">name</span>) =&gt;</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"title function_\">log</span>(name.<span class=\"title function_\">toUpperCase</span>()); <span class=\"comment\">// name 自動推論為 string</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h1 id=\"type-assertions型別斷言\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#type-assertions型別斷言\">#</a> Type Assertions (型別斷言)</h1>\n<p>TypeScript 中的型別斷言是一種機制，用來告訴編譯器「我知道這個值的型別」，即使它現在是  <code>any</code>  或  <code>unknown</code> 。</p>\n<div class=\"note info\">\n<p><strong>型別斷言不會改變執行時的資料型別，只是用來協助編譯器進行靜態檢查。</strong></p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"基本語法-2\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#基本語法-2\">#</a> 基本語法:</h2>\n<h3 id=\"as-語法\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#as-語法\">#</a>  <code>as</code>  語法</h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight typescript\"><figcaption><span>typescript</span></figcaption><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">const</span> input = <span class=\"variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"title function_\">querySelector</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;#my-input&quot;</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> <span class=\"title class_\">HTMLInputElement</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"title function_\">log</span>(input.<span class=\"property\">value</span>);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"type語法\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#type語法\">#</a>  <code>&lt;type&gt;</code>  語法</h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight typescript\"><figcaption><span>typescript</span></figcaption><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">const</span> input = &lt;<span class=\"title class_\">HTMLInputElement</span>&gt;<span class=\"variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"title function_\">querySelector</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;#my-input&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"title function_\">log</span>(input.<span class=\"property\">value</span>);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<div class=\"note warning\">\n<p>在 React 中應使用 <code>as</code> ，因 <code>&lt;&gt;</code>  會與 JSX 定義元素的寫法產生衝突。</p>\n</div>\n<h1 id=\"參考\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#參考\">#</a> 參考</h1>\n<p><span class=\"exturl\" data-url=\"aHR0cHM6Ly9pdGhlbHAuaXRob21lLmNvbS50dy9hcnRpY2xlcy8xMDM1Nzg0MA==\">https://ithelp.ithome.com.tw/articles/10357840</span><br />\n<span class=\"exturl\" data-url=\"aHR0cHM6Ly9pdGhlbHAuaXRob21lLmNvbS50dy9tL2FydGljbGVzLzEwMjYzNzk1\">https://ithelp.ithome.com.tw/m/articles/10263795</span><br />\n<span class=\"exturl\" data-url=\"aHR0cHM6Ly9qaW1teXN3ZWJub3RlLmNvbS90eXBlc2NyaXB0LXR5cGUtYXNzZXJ0aW9uLw==\">https://jimmyswebnote.com/typescript-type-assertion/</span><br />\n<span class=\"exturl\" data-url=\"aHR0cHM6Ly93aWxsaC5naXRib29rLmlvL3R5cGVzY3JpcHQtdHV0b3JpYWwvYmFzaWNzL3R5cGUtYXNzZXJ0aW9u\">https://willh.gitbook.io/typescript-tutorial/basics/type-assertion</span></p>\n",
            "tags": [
                "程式語言筆記",
                "TypeScript",
